{"seq":3,"slug":"latency-bandwidth","title":"延迟、带宽与抖动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/foundations/latency-bandwidth","wordCount":1336,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"延迟-带宽与抖动\">延迟、带宽与抖动</h1><p>网络同步的所有聪明设计，最终都要在三个硬指标面前低头：包从你这到对端要多久（延迟）、每秒能塞多少字节（带宽）、以及这两者有多不稳定（抖动与丢包）。它们是物理与运营商决定的边界条件，工程师改不了，只能测量、预算、并围绕它们设计。这一篇把这些数字摆上台面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四个度量\">核心概念：四个度量</h2><p>实时游戏网络主要被四个量刻画。理解它们的单位与典型范围，是判断一个同步方案是否现实的前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一次往返 RTT] --&gt; B[单程延迟 ≈ RTT/2]&#10;  B --&gt; C[决定预测距离&lt;br/&gt;与补偿窗口]&#10;  D[带宽 bytes/s] --&gt; E[决定每 tick&lt;br/&gt;可传状态量]&#10;  F[抖动 jitter] --&gt; G[决定插值缓冲&lt;br/&gt;需多大]&#10;  H[丢包率] --&gt; I[决定可靠层&lt;br/&gt;重传策略]\">flowchart TD\n  A[一次往返 RTT] --&gt; B[单程延迟 ≈ RTT/2]\n  B --&gt; C[决定预测距离&lt;br/&gt;与补偿窗口]\n  D[带宽 bytes/s] --&gt; E[决定每 tick&lt;br/&gt;可传状态量]\n  F[抖动 jitter] --&gt; G[决定插值缓冲&lt;br/&gt;需多大]\n  H[丢包率] --&gt; I[决定可靠层&lt;br/&gt;重传策略]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度量</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>良好</th>\n<th>可玩</th>\n<th>难玩</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RTT（往返时延）</td>\n<td>ping 值，一来一回</td>\n<td>&lt; 30 ms</td>\n<td>30–80 ms</td>\n<td>&gt; 150 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽（上行）</td>\n<td>每秒可发字节</td>\n<td>家宽充裕</td>\n<td>移动网受限</td>\n<td>拥塞/限速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抖动 jitter</td>\n<td>RTT 的波动幅度</td>\n<td>&lt; 5 ms</td>\n<td>5–30 ms</td>\n<td>&gt; 50 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丢包率</td>\n<td>丢失包占比</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.5%</td>\n<td>0.5–3%</td>\n<td>&gt; 5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"延迟-从光速到-rtt\">延迟：从光速到 RTT</h2><p>延迟由几部分叠加：传播延迟（信号在介质中跑的物理时间，由距离与光速决定）、传输延迟（把包推上链路的时间，与带宽相关）、排队延迟（在路由器缓冲里等待，是抖动的主要来源）、以及处理延迟。其中传播延迟是不可压缩的下限——光纤里的光速约为真空的三分之二，跨洲单程动辄几十毫秒。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RTT</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>传播</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>传输</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>排队</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>处理</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTT} = 2 \\times (t_{\\text{传播}} + t_{\\text{传输}} + t_{\\text{排队}} + t_{\\text{处理}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">传播</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">传输</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">排队</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">处理</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>游戏关心的往往是单程延迟（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RTT</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTT}/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>），因为它决定了&quot;我看到的对端有多旧&quot;以及&quot;我的输入多久后被对端知晓&quot;。RTT 直接框定了两件后续工作的尺度：客户端要预测多远（<a href=\"../sync-models/client-prediction\">客户端预测与协调</a>），以及服务器要把时间倒回多久来补偿（<a href=\"../techniques/lag-compensation\">延迟补偿与命中判定</a>）。延迟越大，这些技法要&quot;伪造&quot;的时间跨度越大，穿帮风险越高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"带宽-每-tick-的预算\">带宽：每 tick 的预算</h2><p>带宽决定了你每个 tick 能往每个客户端发多少字节。粗算一下就知道为什么不能全量同步：假设一个实体的完整状态 64 字节，场上 100 个实体，tick 率 30 Hz，则每客户端下行约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>192</mn><mtext> </mtext><mn>000</mn><mtext> bytes/s</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mtext> Mbps</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64 \\times 100 \\times 30 = 192\\,000\\ \\text{bytes/s} \\approx 1.5\\ \\text{Mbps}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">192</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bytes/s</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mbps</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>乘上几十名玩家，服务器上行瞬间爆炸。因此状态同步几乎从不全量发送，而是依赖三类节流：<strong>增量编码</strong>（只发相对上一已确认快照的变化）、<strong>兴趣管理 / AOI</strong>（只发玩家附近或相关的实体）、以及<strong>量化压缩</strong>（位置用定点、角度用少量 bit 表示）。这些技术的展开在 <a href=\"../sync-models/state-snapshot\">状态同步与快照</a>。</p>\n<p>锁步模型在带宽上则截然相反：它只发输入指令，与实体数量无关，因此一场上千单位的 RTS 也只需极小带宽——这是它被 RTS 选中的关键原因，详见 <a href=\"../sync-models/lockstep-deterministic\">锁步与确定性模拟</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>同步什么</th>\n<th>带宽随什么增长</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完整状态</td>\n<td>实体数 × tick 率</td>\n<td>几乎不用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量状态</td>\n<td>变化的实体数</td>\n<td>FPS、MMO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅输入</td>\n<td>玩家数（与实体无关）</td>\n<td>RTS、格斗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"抖动与丢包-不稳定才是常态\">抖动与丢包：不稳定才是常态</h2><p>如果延迟恒定，问题会简单得多。真正难缠的是<strong>抖动</strong>——RTT 不停波动，导致包到达的间隔忽快忽慢。若直接按到达时刻渲染远端实体，画面就会卡顿抖动。解法是引入一个有意的接收缓冲：把刚到的状态先攒着，延迟一小段时间（通常 50–150 ms）再平滑播放，用一点点额外延迟换取顺滑。这正是 <a href=\"../techniques/interpolation-extrapolation\">插值与外推</a> 的核心机制。</p>\n<p><strong>丢包</strong>则要求传输层有所应对。游戏几乎都用 UDP 而非 TCP，因为 TCP 的有序可靠重传会造成&quot;队头阻塞&quot;——一个旧包没到，后面所有新包都得干等，对实时游戏是灾难。游戏转而在 UDP 上自建&quot;选择性可靠&quot;：关键事件（开火、死亡）走可靠重传，而位置这类高频状态宁可丢弃旧包、直接用更新的——因为一个过时的位置不值得重传。这套传输层取舍是 <a href=\"../infrastructure/transport-protocols\">传输协议与可靠 UDP</a> 的主题。</p>\n<p>衡量抖动常用相邻包延迟差的统计量，缓冲大小需覆盖大多数抖动峰值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>缓冲</mtext><mo>≳</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>抖动峰值</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>一个 tick 间隔</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{缓冲} \\gtrsim \\max(\\text{抖动峰值}) + \\text{一个 tick 间隔}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缓冲</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">抖动峰值</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一个</span><span class=\"mord\"> tick </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">间隔</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>缓冲设太小会因偶发延迟而断流，设太大则平白增加可感延迟，这是又一处需要按目标网络环境调参的权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四个硬指标——RTT、带宽、抖动、丢包——是物理与运营商给定的边界，只能测量与预算。</li>\n<li>传播延迟是不可压缩下限；RTT 框定了预测距离与延迟补偿窗口的尺度。</li>\n<li>带宽预算决定了几乎不可能全量同步，催生增量编码、兴趣管理、量化压缩；锁步只发输入故与实体数无关。</li>\n<li>抖动用有意的接收缓冲换平滑，是插值的根；丢包促使游戏弃 TCP 用 UDP 上的选择性可靠。</li>\n<li>这些数字是后三章每个技法讨价还价的对象：延迟越大、抖动越烈，伪造与纠错的难度越高。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"延迟、带宽与抖动","id":"延迟-带宽与抖动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四个度量","id":"核心概念-四个度量"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟：从光速到 RTT","id":"延迟-从光速到-rtt"},{"level":2,"text":"带宽：每 tick 的预算","id":"带宽-每-tick-的预算"},{"level":2,"text":"抖动与丢包：不稳定才是常态","id":"抖动与丢包-不稳定才是常态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"权威模型与网络拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/foundations/authority-models"},"next":{"title":"锁步与确定性模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/sync-models/lockstep-deterministic"}}